{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"28178","tmdb_id":"movie/28178","media_type":"movie","title":"忠犬八公的故事","original_title":"Hachi: A Dog's Tale","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCRj02jAyqzDvPEUceFYEA7WmWM.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOeSj4YzwxZb6FgcYPRK2hEzTdt.jpg","overview":"八公 是一条谜一样的犬，因为没有人知道它从哪里来。教授帕克 在小镇的火车站拣到一只走失的小狗，冥冥中似乎注定小狗和帕克教授有着某种缘分，帕克一抱起这只小狗就再也放不下来，最终，帕克对小狗八公的疼爱感化了起初极力反对养狗的妻子卡特。八公在帕克的呵护下慢慢长大，帕克上班时八公会一直把他送到车站，下班时八公也会早早便爬在车站等候，八公的忠诚让小镇的人家对它更加疼爱。有一天，八公在帕克要上班时表现异常，居然玩起了以往从来不会的捡球游戏，八公的表现让帕克非常满意，可是就是在那天，帕克因病去世。帕克的妻子、女儿安迪 及女婿迈克尔 怀着无比沉痛的心情埋葬了帕克，可是不明就里的八公却依然每天傍晚五点准时守候在小站的门前，等待着主人归来……","release_date":"2009-06-08","first_air_date":"","year":"2009","runtime":"93","episode_run_time":"","number_of_episodes":0,"number_of_seasons":0,"genres":["剧情","家庭"],"languages":["English","日本語"],"countries":["United Kingdom","United States of America"],"tmdb_rating":"8.0 / 10 from 7417 users","tmdb_rating_average":8.007,"tmdb_votes":7417,"imdb_id":"tt1028532","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt1028532/","imdb_rating":"8.1 / 10 from 351001 users","imdb_rating_average":"8.1","imdb_votes":"351001","directors":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":5306,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"莱塞·霍尔斯道姆","original_name":"Lasse Hallström","popularity":1.1321,"profile_path":"/zEz9LphkDBcGAAYGdjIU5QzjB9C.jpg","credit_id":"52fe457fc3a368484e05ed23","department":"Directing","job":"Director"}],"producers":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1205,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"理查·基尔","original_name":"Richard Gere","popularity":3.7894,"profile_path":"/i7wcBNmFldh2E4QInCvmv7CPSIR.jpg","credit_id":"563ba038c3a3681b59024481","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":929308,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"Shin Torisawa","original_name":"Shin Torisawa","popularity":0.0749,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"563ba235c3a3681b4d028201","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":3498,"known_fo